  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 836cfc9ef8881a34d91f952ceabb29bf, type: 3}
  m_Name: SpecialSheepCatalog
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SpecialSheepCatalog
  sourceRootFolder: Assets/SpecialSheep
  baseSheepPrefab: {fileID: 2358661416431911602, guid: a8f25a56092d78446aa43868336107a0, type: 3}
  tiers:
  - quality: 1
    folderName: "\u7EFF\u8272\u7F8A"
    probabilityPercent: 20
    entries:
    - assetGuid: 0206aeaa29039e2468693f137e9e4e8a
      typeId: sheep.special.0206aeaa29039e2468693f137e9e4e8a
      lastImportedFileName: "\u86CB\u5C0F\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u86CB\u5C0F\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0206aeaa29039e2468693f137e9e4e8a, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u88F9\u7740\u86CB\u58F3\u95EF\u8349\u539F\uFF0C\u8D70\u8DEF\u603B\u662F\u5494\u54D2\u54CD\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"孵蛋场的登记簿上有一行谁也划不掉的记录，\"登记员说，\"'第 37 颗蛋，孵化成功，品种：羊'——蛋小羊每年生日都来重读一遍，读完还要趴回蛋形的窝里睡一觉。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: 0935fc8ba15224141b77350ee571a4ac
      typeId: sheep.special.0935fc8ba15224141b77350ee571a4ac
      lastImportedFileName: "\u77ED\u77ED\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u77ED\u77ED\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0935fc8ba15224141b77350ee571a4ac, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u5C3E\u5DF4\u3001\u8033\u6735\u548C\u53EB\u58F0\u90FD\u77ED\u77ED\u7684\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"合唱团的'咩'声部总是提前半拍收尾，我批评过全团偷懒，\"指挥说，\"后来我逐一对了谱子，冤枉大家了——短短羊的那一声本来就只有那么长，它已经唱满了。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: 15cb24c4eb0259a478c6a633e5f93f13
      typeId: sheep.special.15cb24c4eb0259a478c6a633e5f93f13
      lastImportedFileName: "\u77EE\u811A\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u77EE\u811A\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 15cb24c4eb0259a478c6a633e5f93f13, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u817F\u867D\u77ED\uFF0C\u8FFD\u8D77\u961F\u4F0D\u4E00\u70B9\u4E5F\u4E0D\u6162\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"这片草原的草长得特别均匀，\"割草工说，\"后来我看见矮脚小羊的脚印才明白——一步顶三步的密度，一口草都没落下，比我割得还整齐。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: 18f9f97a37d03274ebae52fe46769f75
      typeId: sheep.special.18f9f97a37d03274ebae52fe46769f75
      lastImportedFileName: "\u7F8A\u4E86\u4E2A\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u7F8A\u4E86\u4E2A\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 18f9f97a37d03274ebae52fe46769f75, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u95EF\u8FC7\u7B2C\u4E8C\u5173\u540E\uFF0C\u5B83\u9009\u62E9\u4FDD\u6301\u6C89\u9ED8\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"我不知道它的第二关是什么，也不想知道，\"挑战过的羊说，\"我只知道那天出来以后，我沉默着吃了三天草，现在看见'羊'字都要先闭一下眼。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: 218d202a0e4f66a47a6b37ee8b3b3347
      typeId: sheep.special.218d202a0e4f66a47a6b37ee8b3b3347
      lastImportedFileName: "\u773C\u775B\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u773C\u775B\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 218d202a0e4f66a47a6b37ee8b3b3347, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u539A\u773C\u955C\u540E\u85CF\u7740\u4E00\u5F20\u6D3B\u5730\u56FE\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"新来的羊总问我草原地图在哪儿，\"图书管理员说，\"我直接指眼镜羊——比地图准，还带更新，就是问路时它要先扶一扶眼镜，再给你讲一路的第三条近道。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: 230278cf425ff8c459fa2804469f08ec
      typeId: sheep.special.230278cf425ff8c459fa2804469f08ec
      lastImportedFileName: "\u68D5\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u68D5\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 230278cf425ff8c459fa2804469f08ec, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u50CF\u70ED\u53EF\u53EF\u4E00\u6837\u6696\u548C\u9999\u751C\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"冬天牧场栅栏边最挤，我怎么驱都驱不散，\"牧羊犬说，\"后来我闻明白了——大家挤在棕羊身边，说它闻起来像一块正在化开的热巧克力。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: 2eb555e5b4cdd0648931fa96fd0fe6de
      typeId: sheep.special.2eb555e5b4cdd0648931fa96fd0fe6de
      lastImportedFileName: "\u80E1\u5B50\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u80E1\u5B50\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2eb555e5b4cdd0648931fa96fd0fe6de, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u80E1\u5B50\u5F88\u957F\uFF0C\u5E74\u7EAA\u5176\u5B9E\u5E76\u4E0D\u5927\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"我们喊它爷爷，不是因为它老，\"小羊说，\"上回有人喊了声'叔叔'，它当场沉默着量了量自己的胡子，量了整整十分钟——从那以后，大家都喊对了。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: 32612a9bf2012be4a9e686ca8d2b467c
      typeId: sheep.special.32612a9bf2012be4a9e686ca8d2b467c
      lastImportedFileName: "\u80D6\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u80D6\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 32612a9bf2012be4a9e686ca8d2b467c, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u5706\u6EDA\u6EDA\u7684\u8EAB\u5B50\uFF0C\u843D\u5730\u81EA\u5E26\u9707\u611F\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"牧场的地震仪隔几天就报一次警，\"牧场主说，\"维修工来检查了两回，最后把仪器搬走了：机器没坏，是隔壁胖羊又蹦了一下。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: 4babde597b2706744bf88984fa6ad913
      typeId: sheep.special.4babde597b2706744bf88984fa6ad913
      lastImportedFileName: "\u7EC5\u58EB\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u7EC5\u58EB\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4babde597b2706744bf88984fa6ad913, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u6234\u7740\u5355\u7247\u773C\u955C\uFF0C\u559D\u9732\u6C34\u4E5F\u8BB2\u793C\u4EEA\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"清晨的露水其实到处都有，可绅士羊偏要用叶子盛着喝，\"小羊说，\"喝完还要对叶子行个礼——叶子抖了一下，没敢不受，我们也没敢不学。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: 54ec1c67a1168ac4fb19590ca8ec10f1
      typeId: sheep.special.54ec1c67a1168ac4fb19590ca8ec10f1
      lastImportedFileName: "\u957F\u89D2\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u957F\u89D2\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 54ec1c67a1168ac4fb19590ca8ec10f1, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u9876\u89D2\u5E38\u80DC\uFF0C\u6700\u6015\u72ED\u7A84\u7684\u95E8\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"牧场的窄门已经加宽过三次了，\"木匠说，\"每次我问是谁撞的门框，都没羊承认——只有大角羊在我身后仰头看天，角还卡在门框上没拔出来。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: 5dc20a0e928e9984b86b2106ca8af981
      typeId: sheep.special.5dc20a0e928e9984b86b2106ca8af981
      lastImportedFileName: "\u6591\u70B9\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u6591\u70B9\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5dc20a0e928e9984b86b2106ca8af981, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u628A\u5706\u6591\u70B9\u5F53\u4F5C\u6700\u65B0\u6B3E\u7761\u8863\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"我负责全羊群的洗衣活儿，可从没洗过它那件'睡衣'，\"洗衣羊大婶说，\"不过我记着账呢：它每吃完一顿饭，我就得在本子上多描一个圈——这个月的圈，描得特别圆。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: 5f6fb34cd54f8e041abe031718ad1a86
      typeId: sheep.special.5f6fb34cd54f8e041abe031718ad1a86
      lastImportedFileName: "\u7626\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u7626\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5f6fb34cd54f8e041abe031718ad1a86, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u53EA\u5403\u8349\u5C16\uFF0C\u98CE\u5927\u65F6\u5BB9\u6613\u7AD9\u4E0D\u7A33\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"草原上的风其实性子很急，\"蒲公英说，\"但每次路过瘦羊身边，它都会屏住呼吸、踮着脚走——生怕把这位客人给吹跑了。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: 71139a83a98335143ac875ab25ebf650
      typeId: sheep.special.71139a83a98335143ac875ab25ebf650
      lastImportedFileName: "\u957F\u5C3E\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u957F\u5C3E\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 71139a83a98335143ac875ab25ebf650, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u957F\u5C3E\u5DF4\u626B\u8FC7\u8349\u5730\uFF0C\u50CF\u4E00\u628A\u67D4\u8F6F\u626B\u5E1A\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"牧场的小路清晨最干净，我也终于能睡个懒觉了，\"清洁工说，\"别误会，不是我偷懒——长尾羊晨练走一圈，比我扫得还彻底，我只负责查漏补缺。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: 728a837e9f020984684dc1440ef9132f
      typeId: sheep.special.728a837e9f020984684dc1440ef9132f
      lastImportedFileName: "\u5FAE\u535A\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u5FAE\u535A\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 728a837e9f020984684dc1440ef9132f, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u7EA2\u56F4\u8116\u4E00\u5E74\u56DB\u5B63\u90FD\u4E0D\u79BB\u8EAB\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"草原夏天不下雪，可围巾羊的脖子永远是暖红色的，\"小羊说，\"奶奶每年织一条新的，旧的它说'在衣柜里休假'——一年休一条，衣柜快休满了。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: 7d290af0cb825c743aa2823af5dbf5a4
      typeId: sheep.special.7d290af0cb825c743aa2823af5dbf5a4
      lastImportedFileName: "\u5976\u725B\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u5976\u725B\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7d290af0cb825c743aa2823af5dbf5a4, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u575A\u4FE1\u81EA\u5DF1\u662F\u5976\u725B\uFF0C\u5929\u5929\u6392\u961F\u7B49\u6324\u5976\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"挤奶房的桶天天是空的，可门外的队伍天天排到草垛，\"牧场主说，\"我凑近听过——那队'奶牛'等着被挤的时候，一个个咩得可认真了。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: 830438a50411e5741935125f1780748d
      typeId: sheep.special.830438a50411e5741935125f1780748d
      lastImportedFileName: "\u5410\u820C\u5934\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u5410\u820C\u5934\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 830438a50411e5741935125f1780748d, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u7231\u505A\u9B3C\u8138\uFF0C\u5C1D\u751C\u8349\u5C24\u5176\u7075\u654F\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"牧场边的甜草丛总是最先被吃干净，我蹲守多次都没抓到现场，\"园丁羊说，\"其实不用蹲——太阳底下谁的舌头吐得最长最亮，就是谁，它还在冲我做鬼脸。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: 9631761430da7f948acd72f5356f7a12
      typeId: sheep.special.9631761430da7f948acd72f5356f7a12
      lastImportedFileName: "\u5927\u5934\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u5927\u5934\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9631761430da7f948acd72f5356f7a12, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u8111\u888B\u5927\u5927\u7684\uFF0C\u4E3B\u610F\u4E5F\u7279\u522B\u591A\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"羊群遇到难题的时候，大家会先去看大头羊的头，\"小羊说，\"不是围观——是只要那颗头开始缓缓转动，就说明有办法了，全体都能松口气。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: 98327eb238cf7d24f961eaee9a802536
      typeId: sheep.special.98327eb238cf7d24f961eaee9a802536
      lastImportedFileName: "\u6740\u9A6C\u7279\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u6740\u9A6C\u7279\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 98327eb238cf7d24f961eaee9a802536, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u5F69\u8679\u53D1\u578B\u8FCE\u98CE\u7ACB\uFF0C\u51FA\u573A\u81EA\u5E26\u7126\u70B9\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"草原上有一道彩虹，雨后从来不消失，\"摄影羊说，\"我趴了三天草窝想拍它——第四天它转了个身，我才明白那是杀马特羊出门散步。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: 9adc43897770605488ae6018f76ec00b
      typeId: sheep.special.9adc43897770605488ae6018f76ec00b
      lastImportedFileName: "\u7F8A\u53EF\u7F8A\u4E50"
      displayName: "\u7F8A\u53EF\u7F8A\u4E50"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9adc43897770605488ae6018f76ec00b, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u4EC0\u4E48\u4E8B\u90FD\u80FD\u4E50\uFF0C\u662F\u7F8A\u7FA4\u7684\u5F00\u5FC3\u679C\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"草原上最难的活儿是逗它笑，\"讲笑话的羊说，\"我准备了整整一冬的段子——结果它听完只是咧嘴，反倒我被它这一乐给逗笑了，现在我俩是搭档。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: adffaa56da2adb442923553a07568f70
      typeId: sheep.special.adffaa56da2adb442923553a07568f70
      lastImportedFileName: "\u62D0\u6756\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u62D0\u6756\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: adffaa56da2adb442923553a07568f70, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u62D0\u6756\u4E0A\u7684\u6BCF\u9053\u78E8\u75D5\u90FD\u662F\u4E00\u6BB5\u65C5\u7A0B\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"你们小羊总爱比谁走的路多，\"拐杖说，\"我身上的这些磨痕才是它走过的里程——一道痕一个故事，想听的话，得带草来换。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: ae08ffcaa5f023f449b6f484f2093273
      typeId: sheep.special.ae08ffcaa5f023f449b6f484f2093273
      lastImportedFileName: "\u7206\u70B8\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u7206\u70B8\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ae08ffcaa5f023f449b6f484f2093273, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u813E\u6C14\u4E00\u70B9\u5C31\u70B8\uFF0C\u4E09\u79D2\u540E\u53C8\u5FD8\u5149\u3002"
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: b2c55ca9f38de914bad8b079e820c53f
      typeId: sheep.special.b2c55ca9f38de914bad8b079e820c53f
      lastImportedFileName: "\u5927\u773C\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u5927\u773C\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b2c55ca9f38de914bad8b079e820c53f, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u5706\u773C\u775B\u592A\u4F1A\u5356\u840C\uFF0C\u603B\u80FD\u591A\u8BA8\u4E00\u628A\u8349\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"牧场的草料预算总是超支，财务大婶查了半年，\"牧场主说，\"结论是没羊偷吃——是每只路过的羊都忍不住多喂大眼羊一把草，这账，怪它眼睛太圆。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: b476860f485cdb643886656d4e8c0683
      typeId: sheep.special.b476860f485cdb643886656d4e8c0683
      lastImportedFileName: "\u5446\u5446\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u5446\u5446\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b476860f485cdb643886656d4e8c0683, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u53CD\u5E94\u6162\u4E09\u62CD\uFF0C\u7F8A\u6BDB\u5374\u683C\u5916\u67D4\u8F6F\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"叫呆呆羊要连叫三声，\"牧羊人说，\"第一声是通知，第二声是等它缓冲，第三声它才回头——但回头那一下值得等，那身羊毛，摸过的都说值。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: b94a4390c15bf88409064d4dac580546
      typeId: sheep.special.b94a4390c15bf88409064d4dac580546
      lastImportedFileName: "\u957F\u6BDB\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u957F\u6BDB\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b94a4390c15bf88409064d4dac580546, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u7F8A\u6BDB\u50CF\u957F\u88D9\uFF0C\u68B3\u4E00\u6B21\u8981\u4E00\u4E2A\u4E0B\u5348\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"我不是梳子，我是加班工，\"梳子说，\"每次在长毛羊头上上岗是正午，下岗是日落——它还会问我：'要不要再梳一遍？'\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: bd54d8b0630e015479b46a37bd37a16f
      typeId: sheep.special.bd54d8b0630e015479b46a37bd37a16f
      lastImportedFileName: "\u79C3\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u79C3\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bd54d8b0630e015479b46a37bd37a16f, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u5934\u9876\u4EAE\u5F97\u53CD\u5149\uFF0C\u868A\u5B50\u843D\u4E0B\u4E5F\u6253\u6ED1\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"夏天草原上的蚊子最多，可秃羊头顶一口都没被叮过，\"小蚊子说，\"不是不想叮——上回我刚落脚就滑了出去，在空中转了三圈，同伴们笑我到今天。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: caece8ac01e8a684aab87015c3e864c6
      typeId: sheep.special.black
      lastImportedFileName: "\u9ED1\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u9ED1\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: caece8ac01e8a684aab87015c3e864c6, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u591C\u665A\u6349\u8FF7\u85CF\u65F6\u51E0\u4E4E\u65E0\u4EBA\u80FD\u627E\u5230\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"晚上捉迷藏我们从不找黑色小羊，\"白羊说，\"不是找不到，是上回有人黑夜里一屁股坐在它身上，被它讲了半个小时的'捉迷藏礼仪'。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: d70c7e5bc1c67e04eab700c08270bd34
      typeId: sheep.special.d70c7e5bc1c67e04eab700c08270bd34
      lastImportedFileName: "\u6728\u6876\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u6728\u6876\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d70c7e5bc1c67e04eab700c08270bd34, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u4F4F\u5728\u6728\u6876\u91CC\uFF0C\u8FDE\u81EA\u5DF1\u4E5F\u5FD8\u4E86\u539F\u56E0\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"那只桶的木头我每年换一回，桶里的羊倒是从没换过，\"木匠说，\"我问过它为什么住里面，它想了很久：'我也忘了，但里面这张床，确实舒服。'\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: da7f9c6797001d748bdf89b695b1803f
      typeId: sheep.special.da7f9c6797001d748bdf89b695b1803f
      lastImportedFileName: "\u65B9\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u65B9\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: da7f9c6797001d748bdf89b695b1803f, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u8EAB\u4F53\u65B9\u65B9\u6B63\u6B63\uFF0C\u6392\u961F\u4ECE\u4E0D\u7AD9\u6B6A\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"牧场的队伍从不需要整队员，\"牧羊人说，\"只要方羊往队里一站，前后自动对齐——连风路过都要绕着走，不敢吹歪它。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: e14a7e63561e54044a52344ba356125f
      typeId: sheep.special.e14a7e63561e54044a52344ba356125f
      lastImportedFileName: "\u94C3\u94DB\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u94C3\u94DB\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e14a7e63561e54044a52344ba356125f, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u8D70\u8DEF\u53EE\u5F53\u54CD\uFF0C\u6349\u8FF7\u85CF\u4ECE\u6CA1\u8D62\u8FC7\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"草原捉迷藏新增了规则：铃铛羊每轮先当抓人的，\"小羊说，\"不是针对它——上回它躲进草垛，铃铛响了一个钟头，大家趴在草里谁也不好意思出声。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: e8e5bc6e49f64914ba8accf7a74e032d
      typeId: sheep.special.e8e5bc6e49f64914ba8accf7a74e032d
      lastImportedFileName: "\u8349\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u8349\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e8e5bc6e49f64914ba8accf7a74e032d, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u5934\u9876\u5AE9\u8349\uFF0C\u98CE\u6765\u65F6\u6447\u5F97\u6700\u6B22\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"我一度以为草原出了怪事：无风的日子，草也在摇，\"牧羊人说，\"后来我站上高坡才看清——摇得最起劲的是草草羊头顶那株，周围的草都在跟它学。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: eb9d449a099c10f4a9fdd9aff5db526c
      typeId: sheep.special.eb9d449a099c10f4a9fdd9aff5db526c
      lastImportedFileName: "\u82B1\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u82B1\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: eb9d449a099c10f4a9fdd9aff5db526c, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u5934\u9876\u5C0F\u82B1\uFF0C\u8D70\u5230\u54EA\u91CC\u90FD\u5E26\u7740\u9999\u6C14\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"花花羊路过的时候，我们的工蜂会跟着飞出半里地，\"蜜蜂队长说，\"别误会，不是采蜜——是去确认它头顶那朵花，今天有没有开出新品种。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: f8f394ad0561e4845a4db9c9f3a14971
      typeId: sheep.special.f8f394ad0561e4845a4db9c9f3a14971
      lastImportedFileName: "\u6597\u9E21\u773C\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u6597\u9E21\u773C\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f8f394ad0561e4845a4db9c9f3a14971, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u4E24\u773C\u5206\u5DE5\uFF0C\u5DE6\u53F3\u8349\u5806\u90FD\u4E0D\u653E\u8FC7\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"左边的小羊和右边的小羊曾为斗鸡眼羊到底在看谁吵过一架，差点绝交，\"裁判羊说，\"后来真相大白——它看的是它俩身后的两片草堆，谁也没看。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: 6a448262346a0984386d42d6678e096e
      typeId: sheep.special.horned
      lastImportedFileName: "\u5C71\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u5C71\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6a448262346a0984386d42d6678e096e, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u6DF7\u8FDB\u7F8A\u7FA4\u7684\u5C71\u7F8A\uFF0C\u54A9\u58F0\u8FD8\u5728\u7EC3\u4E60\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"我数过三次羊群，每次数都多出一只，\"牧羊人说，\"后来我凑近了看——那一只正踮着后腿站在队尾，练习咩叫，嗓音还有点劈。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: 4ee2e70656116de4387c3e1aa2bc280e
      typeId: sheep.special.redbow
      lastImportedFileName: "\u9886\u7ED3\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u9886\u7ED3\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4ee2e70656116de4387c3e1aa2bc280e, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u5927\u8774\u8776\u7ED3\u6BCF\u5929\u90FD\u8981\u7167\u6C34\u5858\u68C0\u67E5\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"水塘的水中午最清，可蝴蝶结小羊偏要傍晚来照，\"小青蛙说，\"它自己说的，夕阳能给蝴蝶结加一层滤镜——这个秘密我替它保守了一整个夏天。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: 1e313f1c55e99984ea7b21e2fbbf1349
      typeId: sheep.special.tophat
      lastImportedFileName: "\u793C\u5E3D\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u793C\u5E3D\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1e313f1c55e99984ea7b21e2fbbf1349, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u89C1\u9762\u5148\u8131\u5E3D\uFF0C\u518D\u90D1\u91CD\u5730\u54A9\u4E00\u58F0\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"草原上的小狗们有个不成文的规矩：礼帽小羊路过时，要排好队让它挨个视察，\"牧羊犬说，\"不是怕它，是怕不回礼的话，它会一直举着帽子站在原地，大家都尴尬。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
  - quality: 2
    folderName: "\u84DD\u8272\u7F8A"
    probabilityPercent: 5
    entries:
    - assetGuid: 000e34284b1b0494d941f0c9f544be4a
      typeId: sheep.special.000e34284b1b0494d941f0c9f544be4a
      lastImportedFileName: "\u7EB8\u76D2\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u7EB8\u76D2\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 000e34284b1b0494d941f0c9f544be4a, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u7EB8\u76D2\u662F\u5E3D\u5B50\u3001\u623F\u5B50\uFF0C\u4E5F\u662F\u5B83\u7684\u5B89\u5168\u611F\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"废品站的纸盒永远不够用，\"站长羊说，\"不是货源少——是纸羊把带窗户图案的盒子全挑走了，说'住带窗的，心情好'，我们只好给它留一摞。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: 2c7c4123218e93345b77ceaa5597caaf
      typeId: sheep.special.2c7c4123218e93345b77ceaa5597caaf
      lastImportedFileName: "\u6CE1\u6CE1\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u6CE1\u6CE1\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2c7c4123218e93345b77ceaa5597caaf, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u5FC3\u60C5\u4F1A\u53D8\u6210\u4E0D\u540C\u989C\u8272\u7684\u6CE1\u6CE1\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"草原的孩子们最爱追着它跑，\"牧羊犬说，\"它一开心，泡泡能飘满半个草原——上回它连着乐了三天，牧场的晾衣绳上挂满了没破的泡泡，谁也不舍得戳。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: 2eb5fe3bfe39a23408edeaa1cbed1b8d
      typeId: sheep.special.2eb5fe3bfe39a23408edeaa1cbed1b8d
      lastImportedFileName: "\u6D3E\u5BF9\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u6D3E\u5BF9\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2eb5fe3bfe39a23408edeaa1cbed1b8d, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u5F69\u706F\u4E00\u4EAE\uFF0C\u5B83\u5C31\u80FD\u628A\u8349\u539F\u53D8\u6210\u821E\u6C60\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"草原的日历被它改过，\"日历管理员说，\"一年 365 天，它标了 400 个'派对日'——多出来的那些是'预办'和'补办'，它说派对这东西，宁可多办不能漏办。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: 377007ceb0ca795438a7d1b84361699d
      typeId: sheep.special.377007ceb0ca795438a7d1b84361699d
      lastImportedFileName: "\u6C14\u7403\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u6C14\u7403\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 377007ceb0ca795438a7d1b84361699d, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u7F8A\u6BDB\u8F7B\u5F97\u4F1A\u98D8\uFF0C\u51FA\u95E8\u8981\u62F4\u5C0F\u77F3\u5934\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"草原的风筝线从来不够用，\"放风筝的羊说，\"都借给气球羊了——上回风太大，它飘到了邻镇，靠着一根红线被我们拽回来，落地第一句是：'上面风景真不错。'\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: 7145b2ae1546a274e87f235836291532
      typeId: sheep.special.7145b2ae1546a274e87f235836291532
      lastImportedFileName: "\u8611\u83C7\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u8611\u83C7\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7145b2ae1546a274e87f235836291532, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u96E8\u540E\u5934\u9876\u8611\u83C7\u4F1A\u6491\u6210\u4E00\u628A\u5C0F\u4F1E\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"雨后我进丛林采蘑菇，回回空手，\"采菇羊说，\"不是没有——是全长在蘑菇羊头上了，它还蹲在那儿等我，伞盖撑得特别开，像在说：今天这朵，格外肥。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: 8e24a59250e5faa458c4d268b74777bf
      typeId: sheep.special.8e24a59250e5faa458c4d268b74777bf
      lastImportedFileName: "\u6C34\u6BCD\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u6C34\u6BCD\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8e24a59250e5faa458c4d268b74777bf, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u534A\u900F\u660E\u53C8\u4F1A\u53D1\u5149\uFF0C\u50CF\u6E38\u52A8\u7684\u6708\u5149\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"夜班的牧羊犬从不打手电，\"牧羊犬说，\"水母羊飘在前面照路就够了——它高兴时发暖光，警惕时发冷光，比灯笼懂事，还会自己绕开水坑。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: cb84fbf1582531943b56d4fda6e4fe9d
      typeId: sheep.special.cb84fbf1582531943b56d4fda6e4fe9d
      lastImportedFileName: "\u9A82\u9A82\u54A7\u54A7\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u9A82\u9A82\u54A7\u54A7\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cb84fbf1582531943b56d4fda6e4fe9d, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u5634\u4E0A\u4E0D\u505C\u62B1\u6028\uFF0C\u624B\u91CC\u7684\u6D3B\u5374\u5168\u505A\u5B8C\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"修栅栏那回它骂了我一路，\"木匠说，\"'手法糙''钉子歪''这活儿迟早塌'——骂完它自己把栅栏重新钉了一遍，钉得比我的还结实，走的时候还骂了句'下回别叫我'，第二天照来。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: e809572861cecd04ba4d4a633128546d
      typeId: sheep.special.e809572861cecd04ba4d4a633128546d
      lastImportedFileName: "\u54ED\u54ED\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u54ED\u54ED\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e809572861cecd04ba4d4a633128546d, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u5F00\u5FC3\u96BE\u8FC7\u90FD\u4F1A\u54ED\uFF0C\u6CEA\u6C34\u80FD\u6ECB\u517B\u9752\u8349\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"草原上有一片草长得比别处高半尺，\"园丁羊说，\"我研究了一个月，土壤、光照都没异常——后来发现是哭哭羊天天在那儿哭，它的眼泪，比什么肥都好使。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
  - quality: 3
    folderName: "\u7D2B\u8272\u7F8A"
    probabilityPercent: 1
    entries:
    - assetGuid: 01878f4d0b51ef240ac7a0ba467e4b12
      typeId: sheep.special.01878f4d0b51ef240ac7a0ba467e4b12
      lastImportedFileName: "\u96EA\u82B1\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u96EA\u82B1\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 01878f4d0b51ef240ac7a0ba467e4b12, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u6BDB\u5C16\u51DD\u7740\u96EA\u82B1\uFF0C\u603B\u6BD4\u51AC\u5929\u65E9\u4E00\u6B65\u3002"
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: 19ea857c7354c514ea533cdaba30ed6a
      typeId: sheep.special.19ea857c7354c514ea533cdaba30ed6a
      lastImportedFileName: "\u94B1\u888B\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u94B1\u888B\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 19ea857c7354c514ea533cdaba30ed6a, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u80FD\u542C\u89C1\u8349\u4E1B\u91CC\u6BCF\u4E00\u679A\u786C\u5E01\u7684\u58F0\u97F3\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"它借出去的钱从没打过欠条，\"账房羊说，\"我问它不怕赖账吗，它把钱袋晃了晃：'响一声，就当我记下了。'——奇怪的是，草原上真没羊赖过它的账。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: 4b4830bec0b10044584d3dfa3494d5e6
      typeId: sheep.special.4b4830bec0b10044584d3dfa3494d5e6
      lastImportedFileName: "\u68C9\u82B1\u7CD6\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u68C9\u82B1\u7CD6\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4b4830bec0b10044584d3dfa3494d5e6, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u4E00\u53EA\u72EC\u7279\u7684\u68C9\u82B1\u7CD6\u7F8A\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"我在集市做棉花糖多年，这半年生意惨得很，\"棉花糖贩羊说，\"不是我手艺退步——是大家都说棉花糖羊的毛更新鲜更甜，还附赠一只会眨眼的活羊。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: 4e04cabfad45fdf4b82b54c34031e4a0
      typeId: sheep.special.4e04cabfad45fdf4b82b54c34031e4a0
      lastImportedFileName: "\u91D1\u5E01\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u91D1\u5E01\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4e04cabfad45fdf4b82b54c34031e4a0, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u4E00\u53EA\u72EC\u7279\u7684\u91D1\u5E01\u7F8A\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"草原的失物招领箱空了很久，\"失物管理员羊说，\"不是没人丢东西——是亮闪闪的全被金币羊先捡走了，它会留一张欠条：'利息：一把甜草。'\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: 645afb470bf2b854faa5714d59d34746
      typeId: sheep.special.645afb470bf2b854faa5714d59d34746
      lastImportedFileName: "\u56DB\u5C3E\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u56DB\u5C3E\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 645afb470bf2b854faa5714d59d34746, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u4E00\u53EA\u72EC\u7279\u7684\u56DB\u5C3E\u7F8A\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"草原的旗帜节从不用做旗，\"节庆羊说，\"借四尾羊的就行——四条尾巴一齐挥，节奏还不带错的，比旗队整齐多了。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: 6b4b5a5a0f127b947b55830449aab520
      typeId: sheep.special.6b4b5a5a0f127b947b55830449aab520
      lastImportedFileName: "\u6C34\u679C\u635E\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u6C34\u679C\u635E\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6b4b5a5a0f127b947b55830449aab520, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u4E00\u53EA\u72EC\u7279\u7684\u6C34\u679C\u635E\u7F8A\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"我摆水果摊多年，叫不出它身上全部的水果名，\"水果贩羊说，\"水果捞羊天天来让我鉴定——昨天是草莓，今天是菠萝，它说这叫'换口味'。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: 733c7e54559b1cf4e912d4e8e27b9b6a
      typeId: sheep.special.733c7e54559b1cf4e912d4e8e27b9b6a
      lastImportedFileName: "\u52C7\u8005\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u52C7\u8005\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 733c7e54559b1cf4e912d4e8e27b9b6a, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u5371\u9669\u5F80\u54EA\u6765\uFF0C\u5B83\u5C31\u5F80\u54EA\u51B2\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"羊群的疏散演习总是反过来进行，\"牧羊犬说，\"全体往外跑，只有勇者羊往里冲——去确认还有谁没出来，每次回来都一身泥，还咧嘴笑。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: 78aaa99b610d3064caa7c41bae238cca
      typeId: sheep.special.78aaa99b610d3064caa7c41bae238cca
      lastImportedFileName: "\u58EE\u7F8A\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u58EE\u7F8A\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 78aaa99b610d3064caa7c41bae238cca, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u4E00\u80A9\u625B\u8D77\u8349\u579B\uFF0C\u662F\u7F8A\u7FA4\u7684\u529B\u91CF\u62C5\u5F53\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"搬家公司在草原丢了半个市场，\"搬家公司老板羊说，\"不是大家不搬家，是都去找壮羊——报酬一把甜草，比我们搬得又快又稳。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: 7e9ca27d09b4a034faa94a204aaa4394
      typeId: sheep.special.7e9ca27d09b4a034faa94a204aaa4394
      lastImportedFileName: "\u62AB\u7740\u72FC\u76AE\u7684\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u62AB\u7740\u72FC\u76AE\u7684\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7e9ca27d09b4a034faa94a204aaa4394, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u60F3\u6F5C\u5165\u72FC\u7FA4\uFF0C\u5374\u603B\u88AB\u54A9\u58F0\u66B4\u9732\u3002"
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: 9906342ae33cd4147bffad8eaa8772b3
      typeId: sheep.special.9906342ae33cd4147bffad8eaa8772b3
      lastImportedFileName: "\u516C\u5B50\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u516C\u5B50\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9906342ae33cd4147bffad8eaa8772b3, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u4E00\u53EA\u72EC\u7279\u7684\u516C\u5B50\u7F8A\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"草原的草价表是它一手改写的，\"草贩羊说，\"它付双倍价钱，但有个条件——我递草的时候必须多说一句：'谢谢车公子。'\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: 9ad74cef5e62004468499827eb70b6f2
      typeId: sheep.special.9ad74cef5e62004468499827eb70b6f2
      lastImportedFileName: "\u7206\u70B8\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u7206\u70B8\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9ad74cef5e62004468499827eb70b6f2, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u4E00\u53EA\u72EC\u7279\u7684\u7206\u70B8\u7F8A\u3002"
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: aaa83775e5e39d441aa10ead7910ed40
      typeId: sheep.special.aaa83775e5e39d441aa10ead7910ed40
      lastImportedFileName: "\u7EA2\u5185\u88E4\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u7EA2\u5185\u88E4\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: aaa83775e5e39d441aa10ead7910ed40, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u76F8\u4FE1\u7EA2\u5185\u88E4\u80FD\u5E26\u6765\u795E\u79D8\u529B\u91CF\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"草原有个传说：红内裤穿在外面就能当超级英雄，\"小羊说，\"它真试了——穿了三天又改回里面，说草原风大，有点凉。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: ae2e0ca15c5441747951ba7a3a57cf35
      typeId: sheep.special.ae2e0ca15c5441747951ba7a3a57cf35
      lastImportedFileName: "\u516C\u4E3B\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u516C\u4E3B\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ae2e0ca15c5441747951ba7a3a57cf35, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u4E00\u53EA\u72EC\u7279\u7684\u516C\u4E3B\u7F8A\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"草原有一条红毯，只在公主羊出门时铺，\"管家羊说，\"后来我学乖了，铺一半就停——剩下那段它自己踮着脚走完，说这是在'练习仪态'。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: c32e825537e9091478418bf505d47057
      typeId: sheep.special.c32e825537e9091478418bf505d47057
      lastImportedFileName: "\u96EA\u5730\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u96EA\u5730\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c32e825537e9091478418bf505d47057, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u8D8A\u662F\u5929\u5BD2\u5730\u51BB\uFF0C\u7CBE\u795E\u8D8A\u597D\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"冬天捉迷藏我们直接放弃找雪地羊，\"小羊说，\"上回找到天黑，最后是它自己冷了，走过来蹭我们取暖——我们才发现它一直站在我旁边，站了两个钟头。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: cd2ab0ac9c4f2924a97abff50cb9b44a
      typeId: sheep.special.cd2ab0ac9c4f2924a97abff50cb9b44a
      lastImportedFileName: "\u96F7\u4E91\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u96F7\u4E91\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cd2ab0ac9c4f2924a97abff50cb9b44a, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u4E00\u53EA\u72EC\u7279\u7684\u96F7\u4E91\u7F8A\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"它的发布会讲稿有三百页，二百九十页在对比上一代羊毛，\"场务羊说，\"最后一页永远是同一行字：'这一次，我们认真了。'\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: ec234c28a34f61a49974e6317f014790
      typeId: sheep.special.ec234c28a34f61a49974e6317f014790
      lastImportedFileName: "\u81ED\u81ED\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u81ED\u81ED\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ec234c28a34f61a49974e6317f014790, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u6C14\u5473\u5F88\u6709\u5B58\u5728\u611F\uFF0C\u868A\u866B\u90FD\u4E3B\u52A8\u7ED5\u8DEF\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"羊群的蚊虫密度图上有一块空白圆圈，\"昆虫学家羊说，\"没蚊子、没苍蝇、连蚂蚁都没有——圆心是臭臭羊，它还在纳闷大家打招呼为什么都屏住呼吸。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: f2203e57048de9f408944e84a29293fc
      typeId: sheep.special.f2203e57048de9f408944e84a29293fc
      lastImportedFileName: "\u7F8A\u7D22"
      displayName: "\u7F8A\u7D22"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f2203e57048de9f408944e84a29293fc, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u8FCE\u7740\u5927\u98CE\u7AD9\u5C97\uFF0C\u5634\u91CC\u603B\u5FF5\u9762\u5BF9\u75BE\u98CE\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"竞技场的对决榜上有一行三年没擦掉的战绩：0/21/3，\"记分羊说，\"我劝它抹了算了，它按住冲天辫摇头：'留着。剑客的战绩不在胜负——在当天风有没有呼啸。'说完又输了一场，战绩没变。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: fe5b7634969c4bc4187db0b85df40efd
      typeId: sheep.special.fe5b7634969c4bc4187db0b85df40efd
      lastImportedFileName: "\u56DB\u53F6\u8349\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u56DB\u53F6\u8349\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fe5b7634969c4bc4187db0b85df40efd, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u4E00\u53EA\u72EC\u7279\u7684\u56DB\u53F6\u8349\u7F8A\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"探路这种活儿我从不抽签，\"探险羊说，\"直接推四叶草羊出去——上回它绊了一跤，爬起来的时候，替全群发现了一处新水源。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
  - quality: 4
    folderName: "\u91D1\u8272\u7F8A"
    probabilityPercent: 0.3
    entries:
    - assetGuid: 4b83fc11c506d4a4e8bb4d10be427a0f
      typeId: sheep.special.4b83fc11c506d4a4e8bb4d10be427a0f
      lastImportedFileName: "\u5F69\u8679\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u5F69\u8679\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4b83fc11c506d4a4e8bb4d10be427a0f, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u8D70\u8FC7\u4E4B\u5904\u4F1A\u7559\u4E0B\u4E00\u9053\u4E03\u5F69\u5C3E\u8FF9\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"草原的天气预报早就不看云了，\"气象羊说，\"看彩虹羊的尾巴就行——颜色鲜亮是晴，颜色发灰要下雨，比我的气压计准，还不会坏。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: 599947171a74b0442883ad306e5afb97
      typeId: sheep.special.599947171a74b0442883ad306e5afb97
      lastImportedFileName: "\u5927\u7F8A\u53EB"
      displayName: "\u5927\u7F8A\u53EB"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 599947171a74b0442883ad306e5afb97, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u4E00\u58F0\u54A9\u80FD\u4F20\u8FC7\u4E09\u5EA7\u5C71\u8C37\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"跟它玩捉迷藏纯拼耐力，\"寻找羊说，\"蒙上眼睛，全靠那一声超声波辨位，听了七八回才锁定方向——结果它一直站在我身后，憋笑憋得尾巴直抖。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: 624118cf49354ea47a0186f0af832ea0
      typeId: sheep.special.624118cf49354ea47a0186f0af832ea0
      lastImportedFileName: "\u4E5D\u5C3E\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u4E5D\u5C3E\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 624118cf49354ea47a0186f0af832ea0, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u4E5D\u6761\u5F69\u5C3E\u5C55\u5F00\u65F6\uFF0C\u8349\u539F\u4E5F\u4EAE\u4E86\u8D77\u6765\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"第九条尾巴凑齐那天，全草原都安静了，\"长尾羊说，\"粉光从草垛里升起来的时候我闭了下眼——再睁开，它正冲我摇九条尾巴，一条一条，像在数给我们听。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: 655462e028f5997488d0796ba8f01e1a
      typeId: sheep.special.655462e028f5997488d0796ba8f01e1a
      lastImportedFileName: "\u7F8E\u7F8A\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u7F8E\u7F8A\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 655462e028f5997488d0796ba8f01e1a, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u4ECE\u72FC\u5821\u56DE\u5BB6\u540E\uFF0C\u7F8A\u6BDB\u4E00\u76F4\u95EA\u7740\u5149\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"狼堡的栅栏被撬开那天，全草原都屏住了呼吸，\"摄影羊说，\"美羊羊慢慢走出来，逆着光——那张照片至今挂在草原入口，标题就两个字：回家。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: 7daa4a91d90a5244092bc9a253c44ffb
      typeId: sheep.special.7daa4a91d90a5244092bc9a253c44ffb
      lastImportedFileName: "\u6291\u90C1\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u6291\u90C1\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7daa4a91d90a5244092bc9a253c44ffb, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u8EB2\u5728\u6697\u5904\uFF0C\u53EA\u6709\u6E29\u67D4\u7684\u5149\u80FD\u8BA9\u5B83\u5B89\u5FC3\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"丛林里有片连阳光都绕着走的地方，就是它的家，\"带路羊说，\"我们举着发光羊一步步挪过去，光照到它脸上的那一刻，它眨了眨眼——原来它的眼睛，一直都很亮很亮。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: a5f309fe2b04ddc4291a34c114f1f994
      typeId: sheep.special.a5f309fe2b04ddc4291a34c114f1f994
      lastImportedFileName: "\u62AB\u7740\u72FC\u76AE\u7684\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u62AB\u7740\u72FC\u76AE\u7684\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a5f309fe2b04ddc4291a34c114f1f994, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u60F3\u6F5C\u5165\u72FC\u7FA4\uFF0C\u5374\u603B\u88AB\u54A9\u58F0\u66B4\u9732\u3002"
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
    - assetGuid: d23a1bf8e0b4185408eaafba29ab4d73
      typeId: sheep.special.d23a1bf8e0b4185408eaafba29ab4d73
      lastImportedFileName: "\u7C91\u7C91\u7F8A"
      displayName: "\u7C91\u7C91\u7F8A"
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d23a1bf8e0b4185408eaafba29ab4d73, type: 3}
      codexDescription: "\u8D70\u5230\u54EA\u62C9\u5230\u54EA\uFF0C\u81EA\u5DF1\u5374\u6BEB\u65E0\u5BDF\u89C9\u3002"
      flavorText: "\"我一直以为'拉够一千坨'只是任务板上的一个数字，\"牧场主说，\"直到那天计数满格，粑羊从地平线那头颠颠跑过来——全羊群跟在它后面数了一路，现在谁也不跟它玩捉迷藏了，太有味儿了。\""
      visualEffectDescription: 
      gameplayEffectDescription: 
      unlockHint: 
      spawnEnabled: 1
  - quality: 5
    folderName: "\u5F69\u8272\u7F8A"
